{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the role of Claire, a young detective looking to make a name for herself \ud83d\udd0e !\u00a0Solve the intriguing <i>mystery</i> of Flavoria lake and its enigmatic <strong>monster</strong> !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ask the <i>wacky</i> characters <i>nosy questions</i> and help them get to the bottom of your investigation !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892520/extras/83fd408e3a51ab0d26c563b3f1aff8ce.avif?t=1753969734\" width=616 height=246 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u26a0\ufe0fWARNING\u26a0\ufe0f: This is a short game ! Expect to play for an hour or so !</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892520/extras/2a50ade4deb29020d4f831bcc65cfd60.avif?t=1753969734\" width=616 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tourist took a <i><span class=\"bb_strike\">super-blurry</span></i> photo of a monster at Flavoria lake !\u00a0While <i>geeks</i> argue on <i>Reddot</i> about whether it's a <i>fake</i> or not, enthusiasts from all over the region are rushing to find this <i>famous</i> creature !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give your detective career a boost and prove to everyone that this monster exists !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you have the courage to face the <i>mosquitoes</i> \ud83e\udd9f ?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if you could earn some\u00a0<i>money</i> in the process... that would be great !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892520/extras/698f803ef0782458da28d188cd3389e2.avif?t=1753969734\" width=616 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An adventure game with a <i>hint(lol)</i> of platforming too !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You'll have a great time :</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walking simulator with a bit of platform \ud83e\udd0f</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Funny</i> dialogues \ud83e\udd21</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A talking penguin hat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An old dog\ud83d\udc36 shamelessly ripping you off with a <i>jPhone 18</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breathtaking aquatic exploration \ud83e\udee7 <i>(no)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There may be a <i>monster</i> underwater</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3892520?t=1753969734","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892520/1e1aedefc4b6f9f1953b8458b804f4a776a09f7f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753969734","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892520/f79048b4c318efc27d0bc972e720af917ced8e4a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753969734","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892520/f79048b4c318efc27d0bc972e720af917ced8e4a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753969734","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the role of Claire, a young detective looking to make a name for herself \ud83d\udd0e !\u00a0Solve the intriguing <i>mystery</i> of Flavoria lake and its enigmatic <strong>monster</strong> !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ask the <i>wacky</i> characters <i>nosy questions</i> and help them get to the bottom of your investigation !</p><p class=\"bb_